          "settings": {
            "heading": "Material",
            "description": "<p>Each piece is <strong>coated with a thicker layer of 18K gold using advanced PVD (Physical Vapour Deposition) technology</strong>, a process that bonds the gold to the stainless steel at a molecular level.<br/><br/>This makes our jewellery <strong>up to 10 times more durable than standard fashion plating</strong>, with a <strong>superior waterproof and tarnish-resistant finish</strong> — stronger and longer-lasting than traditional gold vermeil.</p>",
