            "description": "<p><strong>How do I care for my jewellery?</strong><br/><br/>Our pieces are made for everyday wear, but a little care goes a long way:</p><ul><li>Avoid direct contact with harsh chemicals, perfumes, and cleaning agents.<br/></li><li>After swimming, rinse with clean water and gently dry.<br/></li><li>Store your jewellery in the pouch or box provided when not in use.<br/></li></ul>",
