    "collapsible-rows": {
      "type": "collapsible-rows",
      "blocks": {
        "collapsible-row-1": {
          "type": "collapsible-row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "What materials are used in your jewelry?",
            "description": "<p>Each House of Even piece is crafted from <strong>high-quality recyclable stainless steel</strong> and finished with a <strong>thicker layer of 18k PVD gold plating</strong> — a process that makes our gold tone <strong>shinier, lighter, and far more durable</strong> than regular gold-plated jewellery on the market.<br/><br/>Many designs are adorned with <strong>natural freshwater pearls, gemstones, and crystals</strong>, making every piece truly unique.</p>",
            "page-content": "",
            "default-open": false
          }
        },
        "collapsible-row-2": {
          "type": "collapsible-row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Are your materials ethically sourced?",
            "description": "<p>Yes. We work closely with trusted suppliers who follow responsible and ethical sourcing practices. Our commitment is to create beautiful pieces that reflect care for both the people who make them and the planet that inspires them.</p>",
            "page-content": "",
            "default-open": false
          }
        },
        "collapsible-row-3": {
          "type": "collapsible-row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Do you offer custom jewelry designs?",
            "description": "<p>At this stage, we don’t offer fully custom designs. However, every piece is thoughtfully designed to be mixed and matched through our <strong>Mix. Match. Make it Yours.</strong> concept — allowing you to create your own combinations of charms, chains, and pendants that tell your story.</p>",
            "page-content": "",
            "default-open": false
          }
        },
        "collapsible-row-4": {
          "type": "collapsible-row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "How do I care for my House of Even jewellery?",
            "description": "<p>Our jewellery is made to be lived in, but like all fine pieces, a little care helps it last beautifully.</p><ul><li><br/>Avoid contact with harsh chemicals, perfumes, and cleaning products.<br/></li><li><br/>If your jewellery needs cleaning, <strong>wash it gently with water and mild hand soap</strong>, then pat dry.<br/></li><li><br/><strong>Gently wipe with a soft cloth</strong> after wear to maintain its shine — we include one with every purchase.<br/></li><li><br/>Store pieces individually in their pouch to prevent scratching.<br/></li><li><br/>Extra care is recommended for <strong>natural pearls, stones, and crystals</strong>, as these materials are delicate by nature.<br/></li></ul><p>With proper care, your House of Even jewellery will keep its brilliance for years to come.</p>",
            "page-content": "",
            "default-open": false
          }
        },
        "collapsible-row-5": {
          "type": "collapsible-row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "What is your return policy",
            "description": "<p>We want you to love your jewellery as much as we do.<br/><br/>If you’re not completely happy with your purchase, you can return it within <strong>14 days of delivery</strong> for an exchange or store credit.<br/><br/>Please note that:</p><ul><li>Items must be unworn and in original packaging.<br/></li><li>For hygiene reasons, earrings are final sale.<br/></li><li>Shipping fees are non-refundable.<br/></li></ul><p>Full details can be found in our <strong>Return & Warranty Policy</strong>.</p>",
            "page-content": "",
            "default-open": false
          }
        }
      },
